# =============================================================================
# LOCAL TEST ENVIRONMENT ONLY — committed on purpose.
#
# Points at the local Supabase stack started with `npm run db:start`
# (`supabase start`). Every value here is a public local default printed by
# `supabase status` or a throwaway test value. None of these work against any
# hosted project. Test scripts refuse to run unless the URL host is
# 127.0.0.1/localhost (scripts/lib/assert-local-db.mjs).
#
# Never copy values from .env.local (live remote project) into this file.
# =============================================================================

